"(installedMem)s."

#: pyanaconda/modules/storage/checker/utils.py:322
msgid ""
"A swap partition has not been specified. To significantly improve "
"performance for most installations, it is recommended to specify a swap "
"partition."
msgstr ""
"Nav norādīts maiņatmiņas nodalījums. Lai būtiski uzlabotu veiktspēju vairumā "
"instalāciju, ieteicams norādīt maiņatmiņas nodalījumu."

#: pyanaconda/modules/storage/checker/utils.py:340
msgid ""
"At least one of your swap devices does not have a UUID, which is common in "
"swap space created using older versions of mkswap. These devices will be "
"referred to by device path in /etc/fstab, which is not ideal since device "
"paths can change under a variety of circumstances. "
msgstr ""
"Vismaz vienai maiņatmiņas ierīcei nav UUID, kas ir parasti maiņatmiņai, kas "
"izveidota ar vecākām mkswap versijām. Failā /etc/fstab uz šīm ierīcēm "
"atsauksies pēc ierīces ceļa, kas nav ideāli, jo ierīču ceļi dažādos "
"apstākļos var mainīties. "

